# Docling / DocLang spec currency

Follow the HARD RULE in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md): before changing `parse_docling`, `parse_doclang`, harvest / boundaries / mappers, fixtures, or contract docs, verify we match **current** Docling and DocLang specs.

The pixi lock and in-repo fixtures are what we last shipped, not the spec. Cite PyPI / upstream `spec.md` / `tests/data/valid` / current `docling-core` source. Do not treat `.claude/memory/` dates as current.
